                </p>
                <a href="/Account/Logout" class="btn btn-danger btn-lg w-100 fw-semibold py-3 rounded-2" style="background: #dc2626; border: none; font-size: 1rem; border-radius: 12px; transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.1);" onmouseover="this.style.background='#b91c1c'; this.style.transform='translateY(-1px)';" onmouseout="this.style.background='#dc2626'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)';">
